{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04546","headline":"清明日诏宴宁王山池赋得飞字 · 张说","name":"清明日诏宴宁王山池赋得飞字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日清明宴，佳境惜芳菲。\n摇扬花杂下，娇啭鸎乱飞。\n绿渚传歌榜，红桥度舞旗。\n和风偏应律，细雨不沾衣。\n承恩如改火，春去春来归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}